(1078609, 130762, 3306, '<td valign="top">Hidden faces!! Nice try. Good picture but missed on the description of the challenge.</td>', 'Hidden faces!! Nice try. Good picture but missed on the description of the challenge.', '2004-12-27 07:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078612, 130858, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is very creative and imaginative. It obviously took alot of time to develop the idea, create, shoot and develop. Photographically it is very interesting and it is one of the better pictures in the challenge.  I think, unfortunately,  that it might not get the score it deserves as it may not be perceived as "Natural" Great job though.</td>', 'This is very creative and imaginative. It obviously took alot of time to develop the idea, create, shoot and develop. Photographically it is very interesting and it is one of the better pictures in the challenge.  I think, unfortunately,  that it might not get the score it deserves as it may not be perceived as "Natural" Great job though.', '2004-12-27 07:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078613, 130807, 23456, '<td valign="top">mmm perhaps the winner....Well done !</td>', 'mmm perhaps the winner....Well done !', '2004-12-27 07:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078618, 130762, 22479, '<td valign="top">I''m sure a million people already told you: this will not work for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Concerning this photograph: good exposure and focus. A bit grainy in the shadows though. Quality of the photo is overall adequate, but you will get voted down for not meeting the challenge requirements.</td>', 'I''m sure a million people already told you: this will not work for this challenge. Concerning this photograph: good exposure and focus. A bit grainy in the shadows though. Quality of the photo is overall adequate, but you will get voted down for not meeting the challenge requirements.', '2004-12-27 07:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078622, 130855, 22479, '<td valign="top">A worthy entry, but you didn''t quite get the focus right here. Not sure what happened. Perhaps your camera''s autofocus went crazy. I recommend checking, then rechecking a shot before you work on it in post processing, or better yet, take enough shots in one sitting to guarantee proper exposure and focus.<br/> <br/>The colors here are a bit flat on the greenery. While I am not a fan of oversaturated colors, this could use a bit of a boost.</td>', 'A worthy entry, but you didn''t quite get the focus right here. Not sure what happened. Perhaps your camera''s autofocus went crazy. I recommend checking, then rechecking a shot before you work on it in post processing, or better yet, take enough shots in one sitting to guarantee proper exposure and focus. The colors here are a bit flat on the greenery. While I am not a fan of oversaturated colors, this could use a bit of a boost.', '2004-12-27 07:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078623, 130762, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, wrong challenge.</td>', 'Great portrait, wrong challenge.', '2004-12-27 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078627, 130854, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is a cute entry. Spotting a face in such a mundane object...you have a good eye. The focus is right. Exposure unfortunately is a bit high.<br/> <br/>I think your angle works well for this object. Hard to get creative, but I feel simplicity is the best approach in this case. Your entry would be stronger if you shot it against a simpler background, say for example the hardwood floor completely filling the frame horizontally rather than obliquely as you have here. Or better yet, shot against a solid color backdrop, either a complementary color or just black.</td>', 'This is a cute entry. Spotting a face in such a mundane object...you have a good eye. The focus is right. Exposure unfortunately is a bit high. I think your angle works well for this object. Hard to get creative, but I feel simplicity is the best approach in this case. Your entry would be stronger if you shot it against a simpler background, say for example the hardwood floor completely filling the frame horizontally rather than obliquely as you have here. Or better yet, shot against a solid color backdrop, either a complementary color or just black.', '2004-12-27 08:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078630, 130846, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very creative entry that works well for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Nice mood created here. Very spooky. Well done with the post processing.</td>', 'Very creative entry that works well for this challenge. Nice mood created here. Very spooky. Well done with the post processing.', '2004-12-27 08:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1078632, 130736, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent and creative entry, strong for this challenge. A bit grainy in shadows but not enough to detract.</td>', 'Excellent and creative entry, strong for this challenge. A bit grainy in shadows but not enough to detract.', '2004-12-27 08:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
