(1078950, 130853, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is a creative entry that appeals to me somehow. Not sure about having that piece of the lid in the shot. Maybe a spoon would have worked better artistically. Overall a great shot and the border compliments well.</td>', 'This is a creative entry that appeals to me somehow. Not sure about having that piece of the lid in the shot. Maybe a spoon would have worked better artistically. Overall a great shot and the border compliments well.', '2004-12-27 14:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
