(1078956, 130265, 22479, '<td valign="top">Creative and artistically presented. My only concern is that those eyes are literally ''eyes'' and thus some may question if this entry meets the challenge requirements (I think it does). With that aside, this is a worthy entry without glaring technical deficits. (probably could have adjusted the saturation selectively to make the red and yellow more lively)</td>', 'Creative and artistically presented. My only concern is that those eyes are literally ''eyes'' and thus some may question if this entry meets the challenge requirements (I think it does). With that aside, this is a worthy entry without glaring technical deficits. (probably could have adjusted the saturation selectively to make the red and yellow more lively)', '2004-12-27 14:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
