(1078966, 130851, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite a unique entry, in that most submitted human faces. Technically and artistically presented very well without any glaring deficits. The background complements the bird well, but the texture is slightly distracting..perhaps a more solid, uniform backdrop would have given this a more clean presentation. Overall a great entry. <br/> <br/>Can''t figure out your title (naughty) but doesn''t bother me.</td>', 'Quite a unique entry, in that most submitted human faces. Technically and artistically presented very well without any glaring deficits. The background complements the bird well, but the texture is slightly distracting..perhaps a more solid, uniform backdrop would have given this a more clean presentation. Overall a great entry.  Can''t figure out your title (naughty) but doesn''t bother me.', '2004-12-27 14:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
