(1080133, 130543, 14603, '<td valign="top">To me, this is the kind of image that the Challenge was crying out for.<br/>Suits the high contrast treatment (although that may not be to everyone`s liking.)<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'To me, this is the kind of image that the Challenge was crying out for.Suits the high contrast treatment (although that may not be to everyone`s liking.)Good luck.', '2004-12-28 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080143, 130823, 14603, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect for the challenge.', '2004-12-28 16:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080154, 130807, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very competent image with a clever title.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Very competent image with a clever title.Good luck', '2004-12-28 16:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080155, 129654, 14603, '<td valign="top">Terrific colours and attractively composed..how fortunate you were to have a "dragon" appear on cue.<br/>One of the best overall images so far.<br/></td>', 'Terrific colours and attractively composed..how fortunate you were to have a "dragon" appear on cue.One of the best overall images so far.', '2004-12-28 16:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080156, 130265, 14603, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could have been taken in Malta.<br/>I saw a lot of these type of boats while on holiday there in 95.<br/>I like this but it will be down to how many voters think it meets the challenge.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'This looks like it could have been taken in Malta.I saw a lot of these type of boats while on holiday there in 95.I like this but it will be down to how many voters think it meets the challenge.Good luck', '2004-12-28 16:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080171, 129566, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the large white bars top and bottom.</td>', 'Too bad about the large white bars top and bottom.', '2004-12-28 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080301, 130642, 24890, '<td valign="top">I think less sky would be good for this shot, but overall I like it alot!  10</td>', 'I think less sky would be good for this shot, but overall I like it alot!  10', '2004-12-28 18:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080304, 130858, 24890, '<td valign="top">Neat concept on the challenge,</td>', 'Neat concept on the challenge,', '2004-12-28 18:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080320, 130762, 13026, '<td valign="top">I believe the rules for this challenge said: "The face you submit may not be something that is intended to be a face (that is, not a person, animal, insect, toy or anything else that has a "face")."<br/>This looks like a person''s face to me.</td>', 'I believe the rules for this challenge said: "The face you submit may not be something that is intended to be a face (that is, not a person, animal, insect, toy or anything else that has a "face")."This looks like a person''s face to me.', '2004-12-28 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080359, 130703, 24454, '<td valign="top">This has to be  one of the winners!    Great job in finding that face!</td>', 'This has to be  one of the winners!    Great job in finding that face!', '2004-12-28 19:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080362, 130747, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a great one!    I hope it''s a winner.</td>', 'This is a great one!    I hope it''s a winner.', '2004-12-28 19:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080363, 130740, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yep. . . the face sure jumps right out at you, with his snow hat on and everything  :)   Good job</td>', 'Yep. . . the face sure jumps right out at you, with his snow hat on and everything  :)   Good job', '2004-12-28 19:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080368, 130848, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yep. . . that is a cute face there alright!   :)</td>', 'Yep. . . that is a cute face there alright!   :)', '2004-12-28 19:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080378, 130512, 10047, '<td valign="top">Easily my favorite for the challenge. I might have tried different croppings and angles, but perhaps you already did. Excellent color composition.</td>', 'Easily my favorite for the challenge. I might have tried different croppings and angles, but perhaps you already did. Excellent color composition.', '2004-12-28 19:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080383, 130807, 10047, '<td valign="top">The cork extractors seemed to be a popular subject for this challenge. This one is well done with interesting and vibrant colors.</td>', 'The cork extractors seemed to be a popular subject for this challenge. This one is well done with interesting and vibrant colors.', '2004-12-28 19:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080386, 130795, 10047, '<td valign="top">Interesting, simple, and creative. I like the composition of blue and brown. The structure seems to have a halo along the blue, but its not too distracting. Not sure if it could be cleaned up or not.</td>', 'Interesting, simple, and creative. I like the composition of blue and brown. The structure seems to have a halo along the blue, but its not too distracting. Not sure if it could be cleaned up or not.', '2004-12-28 19:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080389, 130767, 10047, '<td valign="top">Having difficulty finding the face, but I like the grain and texture. Nicely done. Is the knot an ear?</td>', 'Having difficulty finding the face, but I like the grain and texture. Nicely done. Is the knot an ear?', '2004-12-28 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080392, 130634, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and texture. Haven''t figured out what the object is, but I can see the face. I might have played around with the DOF a little to see if wider made it better or not.</td>', 'Nice contrast and texture. Haven''t figured out what the object is, but I can see the face. I might have played around with the DOF a little to see if wider made it better or not.', '2004-12-28 19:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080398, 130831, 10047, '<td valign="top">Is that the Darth Vader model? Nicely done. The bottom of each feature seems to be a little jaggy, but not distracting. Maybe cropped a little too tight.</td>', 'Is that the Darth Vader model? Nicely done. The bottom of each feature seems to be a little jaggy, but not distracting. Maybe cropped a little too tight.', '2004-12-28 19:49:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1080400, 130196, 10047, '<td valign="top">Liked to see how this was done. Hope you left comments. Nice range of colors and lighting.</td>', 'Liked to see how this was done. Hope you left comments. Nice range of colors and lighting.', '2004-12-28 19:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080405, 130846, 10047, '<td valign="top">WOW! Love the muted colors and shadows. Liked to see it a little lighter around the mouth also, but still very excellent. Bumping up.</td>', 'WOW! Love the muted colors and shadows. Liked to see it a little lighter around the mouth also, but still very excellent. Bumping up.', '2004-12-28 19:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080417, 130705, 10047, '<td valign="top">Looks like an overhead crane. We have four of those at work, and I''ll be cheesed if they all have faces like this. I walk pass them everyday and never saw the opportunity. The lighting is a little harsh, but not sure if you already tried toning it down.</td>', 'Looks like an overhead crane. We have four of those at work, and I''ll be cheesed if they all have faces like this. I walk pass them everyday and never saw the opportunity. The lighting is a little harsh, but not sure if you already tried toning it down.', '2004-12-28 19:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080419, 130703, 10047, '<td valign="top">Creative and original. Excellent detail in the ears. Maybe a little deeper DOF is needed for the chin. Bumping up one point.</td>', 'Creative and original. Excellent detail in the ears. Maybe a little deeper DOF is needed for the chin. Bumping up one point.', '2004-12-28 19:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080420, 130571, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and shadows, and the sky seems vibrant. Can''t decide whether I would have cropped the lower third off to get rid of the light and grid shadow. I guess I''d have to try and see if it made a significant difference.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and shadows, and the sky seems vibrant. Can''t decide whether I would have cropped the lower third off to get rid of the light and grid shadow. I guess I''d have to try and see if it made a significant difference.', '2004-12-28 20:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080421, 130681, 10047, '<td valign="top">Interesting an creative. Not sure if you could get it a tad sharper or not. Still a compelling and moody picture.</td>', 'Interesting an creative. Not sure if you could get it a tad sharper or not. Still a compelling and moody picture.', '2004-12-28 20:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080422, 130824, 10047, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp. A few jaggies along the upper edge. I think the blue foreground gives it a little depth against the black background.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp. A few jaggies along the upper edge. I think the blue foreground gives it a little depth against the black background.', '2004-12-28 20:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080423, 130795, 17113, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait of a red frog.</td>', 'Excellent portrait of a red frog.', '2004-12-28 20:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080424, 130686, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Excellent array of greens, and a little brown on the right to contrast. I wonder if a shallower DOF (background fuzzy) would have made it popped more.</td>', 'Nicely done. Excellent array of greens, and a little brown on the right to contrast. I wonder if a shallower DOF (background fuzzy) would have made it popped more.', '2004-12-28 20:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080425, 130839, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent face, and nice find. I wonder if a vertical crop and shooting at a different time off day would bring it out more.</td>', 'Excellent face, and nice find. I wonder if a vertical crop and shooting at a different time off day would bring it out more.', '2004-12-28 20:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080428, 129708, 10047, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative. Seems a little over processed. The diagonal branches have some jaggies on them.</td>', 'Interesting and creative. Seems a little over processed. The diagonal branches have some jaggies on them.', '2004-12-28 20:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080429, 130779, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice grain and texture. Must be a pine board with that many knots. Well done and a nice find.</td>', 'Nice grain and texture. Must be a pine board with that many knots. Well done and a nice find.', '2004-12-28 20:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080431, 130745, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice find on the face. I wonder if some colored lighting would have helped the features more.</td>', 'Nice find on the face. I wonder if some colored lighting would have helped the features more.', '2004-12-28 20:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080432, 130263, 10047, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute. I think the flower was leading me off the faces. I wonder what the impact would be if you had used colored water in the vase.</td>', 'Took me a minute. I think the flower was leading me off the faces. I wonder what the impact would be if you had used colored water in the vase.', '2004-12-28 20:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080435, 130616, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Not sure about the border thought. Might have cropped it a little lower to take out the reddish color at the top. Well done.</td>', 'Nice composition. Not sure about the border thought. Might have cropped it a little lower to take out the reddish color at the top. Well done.', '2004-12-28 20:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080437, 130807, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a visual treat.  the lighting smacks of eddyg and the title of scalvert.  can''t wait to see who the master behind this one is.  good shot!</td>', 'what a visual treat.  the lighting smacks of eddyg and the title of scalvert.  can''t wait to see who the master behind this one is.  good shot!', '2004-12-28 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080438, 130848, 10047, '<td valign="top">Simple and interesting. Maybe a little more DOF.</td>', 'Simple and interesting. Maybe a little more DOF.', '2004-12-28 20:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080439, 130274, 23394, '<td valign="top">ouuu...this is one where the thumbnail comes across a bit better than the image...<br/>nice find, though.  lighting is a little uneven, but all the same, i''ll give it a 7.  good luck!</td>', 'ouuu...this is one where the thumbnail comes across a bit better than the image...nice find, though.  lighting is a little uneven, but all the same, i''ll give it a 7.  good luck!', '2004-12-28 20:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080440, 130336, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little soft. I know my AF always goes for the darker spots when focusing. Nice composition and contrast.</td>', 'Maybe a little soft. I know my AF always goes for the darker spots when focusing. Nice composition and contrast.', '2004-12-28 20:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080441, 130256, 23394, '<td valign="top">way cool shot!  one of my faves for the challenge.  good luck!</td>', 'way cool shot!  one of my faves for the challenge.  good luck!', '2004-12-28 20:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080442, 130823, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I might have cropped just below the chin to take out the foreground, but maybe that is needed for depth.</td>', 'Nicely done. I might have cropped just below the chin to take out the foreground, but maybe that is needed for depth.', '2004-12-28 20:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080445, 129654, 10047, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Was that the right place at the right time? Nice soft colors and reflection. I might have made the border thinner, but it is still a excellent picture.</td>', 'Very nice. Was that the right place at the right time? Nice soft colors and reflection. I might have made the border thinner, but it is still a excellent picture.', '2004-12-28 20:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080447, 130775, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried a vertical crop and removed the windows on the lower left. Nice color and it meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'I might have tried a vertical crop and removed the windows on the lower left. Nice color and it meets the challenge very well.', '2004-12-28 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080448, 130808, 10047, '<td valign="top">Oh, the things we overlooked. Excellent shot. I wonder what caused the fuzziness on top of the upper receptacle?</td>', 'Oh, the things we overlooked. Excellent shot. I wonder what caused the fuzziness on top of the upper receptacle?', '2004-12-28 20:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080450, 130853, 10047, '<td valign="top">Creative an interesting. I think I would have removed the object in the top background.</td>', 'Creative an interesting. I think I would have removed the object in the top background.', '2004-12-28 20:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080455, 130543, 10047, '<td valign="top">Funny and well done. Excellent lighting and texture. Not sure if I would have cropped it differently or not. Guess I''d have to play around with it.</td>', 'Funny and well done. Excellent lighting and texture. Not sure if I would have cropped it differently or not. Guess I''d have to play around with it.', '2004-12-28 20:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080466, 130641, 10047, '<td valign="top">Wish the lighting was better, but then maybe the face wouldn''t be so visible. I wonder if a higher angle would have gotten rid of the wall and still exposed the face.</td>', 'Wish the lighting was better, but then maybe the face wouldn''t be so visible. I wonder if a higher angle would have gotten rid of the wall and still exposed the face.', '2004-12-28 20:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080468, 130154, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but very interesting. I think I would have cropped with and without the sky to see the impact.</td>', 'A little grainy, but very interesting. I think I would have cropped with and without the sky to see the impact.', '2004-12-28 20:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080470, 130725, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. Simple and creative. The blackness seems to have a little halo around the edges, but its not distracting.</td>', 'Well done. Simple and creative. The blackness seems to have a little halo around the edges, but its not distracting.', '2004-12-28 20:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080473, 130382, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. The lighting seems a bit harsh. I think I would have tried a little darkening and saturation to offset mother nature. Nice find.</td>', 'Excellent capture. The lighting seems a bit harsh. I think I would have tried a little darkening and saturation to offset mother nature. Nice find.', '2004-12-28 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080479, 130828, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice color and implied lines. There are many things in the photo and my attention wasn''t immediately drawn to the boulder. I might have tried a different crop to direct the attention toward the face.</td>', 'Nice color and implied lines. There are many things in the photo and my attention wasn''t immediately drawn to the boulder. I might have tried a different crop to direct the attention toward the face.', '2004-12-28 20:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080485, 130659, 10047, '<td valign="top">Love the lightng, angles, and the composition, but I can''t find the face.</td>', 'Love the lightng, angles, and the composition, but I can''t find the face.', '2004-12-28 20:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080488, 129696, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, and I like the range of blue from top to bottom. I might have tried a little thicker border.</td>', 'Nice capture, and I like the range of blue from top to bottom. I might have tried a little thicker border.', '2004-12-28 20:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080492, 130836, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped more to the left if the turtle face is the one I think it is. Crisp, clean, and well done otherwise.</td>', 'I might have cropped more to the left if the turtle face is the one I think it is. Crisp, clean, and well done otherwise.', '2004-12-28 21:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080533, 130733, 29477, '<td valign="top">great image and facial figures however you need to take advantage of the  640 pixels available to you...some will score low because of the size of your image.  I really like to image created by this tile...do wish it were bigger...6</td>', 'great image and facial figures however you need to take advantage of the  640 pixels available to you...some will score low because of the size of your image.  I really like to image created by this tile...do wish it were bigger...6', '2004-12-28 21:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080545, 130382, 29477, '<td valign="top">great image...I would have rotated 180 to have the image right side up (as I look at the image the knob above the left eye looks like the trunk...not sure if you envisioned it the same way)...6</td>', 'great image...I would have rotated 180 to have the image right side up (as I look at the image the knob above the left eye looks like the trunk...not sure if you envisioned it the same way)...6', '2004-12-28 21:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080548, 130848, 29477, '<td valign="top">great expression...good shot.</td>', 'great expression...good shot.', '2004-12-28 21:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080562, 130571, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top three for this challenge. Beautiful architecture. A few spots in the upper left corner you might clean up. Great shot!</td>', 'This is one of my top three for this challenge. Beautiful architecture. A few spots in the upper left corner you might clean up. Great shot!', '2004-12-28 22:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080576, 130256, 6804, '<td valign="top">Speechless is a perfect title for this entry.  I am surprised to see so many of this type of picture in the challenge, but this is one of my top 3 over-all.  I love the dirty grease look of it and the position is good. I don''t know if the red panel on the left side is adding much to the over-all shot for me. I might have cropped it out and presented a vertical composition without the tilted line. It might help simplify the shot and keep all the attention on the subject.   I don''t think one can truely appreciate a "faces shot" until they actually take the time to hunt for one. It''s not at all as easy as it sounds, is it.  Over-all a great shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Speechless is a perfect title for this entry.  I am surprised to see so many of this type of picture in the challenge, but this is one of my top 3 over-all.  I love the dirty grease look of it and the position is good. I don''t know if the red panel on the left side is adding much to the over-all shot for me. I might have cropped it out and presented a vertical composition without the tilted line. It might help simplify the shot and keep all the attention on the subject.   I don''t think one can truely appreciate a "faces shot" until they actually take the time to hunt for one. It''s not at all as easy as it sounds, is it.  Over-all a great shot for this challenge.', '2004-12-28 22:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080821, 130771, 93, '<td valign="top">Probably the best of the lot.. Great find.</td>', 'Probably the best of the lot.. Great find.', '2004-12-29 00:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080847, 130327, 30490, '<td valign="top">Did this "happen" in reality?  This seems to be "created"</td>', 'Did this "happen" in reality?  This seems to be "created"', '2004-12-29 01:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080849, 130855, 30490, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2004-12-29 01:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080861, 130762, 30490, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to meet the challenge criteria</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to meet the challenge criteria', '2004-12-29 01:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080863, 130842, 30490, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the face</td>', 'I don''t see the face', '2004-12-29 01:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080877, 130659, 30490, '<td valign="top">where is the face?</td>', 'where is the face?', '2004-12-29 01:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080888, 130683, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too distracting</td>', 'Too distracting', '2004-12-29 01:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080902, 130807, 30490, '<td valign="top">I love the colored highlights</td>', 'I love the colored highlights', '2004-12-29 01:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080904, 130747, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great image, love the ice and the colors</td>', 'Great image, love the ice and the colors', '2004-12-29 01:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080912, 130762, 15511, '<td valign="top">Captivating image, but does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Captivating image, but does not meet the challenge.', '2004-12-29 01:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080932, 130263, 15511, '<td valign="top">Beautful image, but...<br/>defies the challenge description.</td>', 'Beautful image, but...defies the challenge description.', '2004-12-29 01:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081035, 130703, 29462, '<td valign="top">Great shot, a great Macro and it meets the challenge so well</td>', 'Great shot, a great Macro and it meets the challenge so well', '2004-12-29 05:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081045, 130319, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very clever, looks like a ribbon to me!</td>', 'Very clever, looks like a ribbon to me!', '2004-12-29 06:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081046, 130457, 23394, '<td valign="top">great find!  this is really a fun photo.  good luck!</td>', 'great find!  this is really a fun photo.  good luck!', '2004-12-29 06:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081047, 130263, 23394, '<td valign="top">great job!  i really do hope you''ll post up some out-takes after the challenge!  good luck!</td>', 'great job!  i really do hope you''ll post up some out-takes after the challenge!  good luck!', '2004-12-29 06:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081050, 130744, 25024, '<td valign="top">I think you could have given this more impact with it cropped round the ''face''</td>', 'I think you could have given this more impact with it cropped round the ''face''', '2004-12-29 06:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081053, 130705, 23394, '<td valign="top">it took me a good look to find the face, and i laughed when i did.  i think your image would have been helped with much tighter cropping<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-05 07:07:10.</i></td>', 'it took me a good look to find the face, and i laughed when i did.  i think your image would have been helped with much tighter cropping', '2004-12-29 06:19:37.000000', '2005-01-05 07:07:10.000000', 1),
(1081057, 130762, 2022, '<td valign="top">It is a great photo, but reading the definition of the challenge I am not sure whether it meets the criteria. (still a 5, great photo)</td>', 'It is a great photo, but reading the definition of the challenge I am not sure whether it meets the criteria. (still a 5, great photo)', '2004-12-29 06:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081105, 130265, 27605, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition.  Were the eyes added for this challenge?</td>', 'Great color and composition.  Were the eyes added for this challenge?', '2004-12-29 07:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081111, 129688, 27605, '<td valign="top">Not one but two!  Tough exposure, nice image.</td>', 'Not one but two!  Tough exposure, nice image.', '2004-12-29 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081115, 130747, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, precise focus, excellent job meeting the challenge.  Good luck, I think this may be a winner.</td>', 'Very nice composition, precise focus, excellent job meeting the challenge.  Good luck, I think this may be a winner.', '2004-12-29 07:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081142, 130659, 11738, '<td valign="top">Please tell us where the hiden face is to be found once the challenge is over.  I have been looking at this image for quite some time now and can''t find it.  Are you referring to people working inside the building or something?</td>', 'Please tell us where the hiden face is to be found once the challenge is over.  I have been looking at this image for quite some time now and can''t find it.  Are you referring to people working inside the building or something?', '2004-12-29 08:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
