(1081529, 130855, 8759, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Good composition though.... Fits the challenge but it is not appealing at all for me. Poor contrast and washed out colours Sorry 3</td>', 'Out of focus. Good composition though.... Fits the challenge but it is not appealing at all for me. Poor contrast and washed out colours Sorry 3', '2004-12-29 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
