(1081542, 130465, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft, and I think the lighting was hampering you. Not sure if you could get more natural lighting in the pic.</td>', 'A little soft, and I think the lighting was hampering you. Not sure if you could get more natural lighting in the pic.', '2004-12-29 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081544, 130740, 8759, '<td valign="top">Would be better with a tighter crop. The subject was very good and fitted the challenge. A close up or fill the frame would be my suggestion Good find though</td>', 'Would be better with a tighter crop. The subject was very good and fitted the challenge. A close up or fill the frame would be my suggestion Good find though', '2004-12-29 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081545, 130771, 10047, '<td valign="top">I would have tried for a tighter crop in the lower left quadrant. That is where I see the face. The background cloud seems a little soft, but I also see a face there.</td>', 'I would have tried for a tighter crop in the lower left quadrant. That is where I see the face. The background cloud seems a little soft, but I also see a face there.', '2004-12-29 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081548, 130852, 10047, '<td valign="top">I like the texure and lighting. I wonder if a tighter crop would expose the face more.</td>', 'I like the texure and lighting. I wonder if a tighter crop would expose the face more.', '2004-12-29 13:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081551, 130477, 8759, '<td valign="top">Crisp and good close up, good DOF. The image is not yet appealing to me. And, sorry to say this, I don''t really see the face</td>', 'Crisp and good close up, good DOF. The image is not yet appealing to me. And, sorry to say this, I don''t really see the face', '2004-12-29 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081552, 130491, 10047, '<td valign="top">The glare is a bit distracting, but this was a nice idea. I might have tried covering or blocking the background.</td>', 'The glare is a bit distracting, but this was a nice idea. I might have tried covering or blocking the background.', '2004-12-29 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081556, 130808, 8759, '<td valign="top">Blurred. Maybe you did not use a tripod in low lightning conditions. The subject is nice but pretty poorly executed. The level of noise is to high.</td>', 'Blurred. Maybe you did not use a tripod in low lightning conditions. The subject is nice but pretty poorly executed. The level of noise is to high.', '2004-12-29 13:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081563, 130543, 8759, '<td valign="top">Extremely funny. I think a tighter crop would do it better. And slightly rotated .... Very expesive and good title. Even if there are some other (few) better entries on the challenge I feel likr bumping up to 8. Good luck</td>', 'Extremely funny. I think a tighter crop would do it better. And slightly rotated .... Very expesive and good title. Even if there are some other (few) better entries on the challenge I feel likr bumping up to 8. Good luck', '2004-12-29 13:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081574, 129993, 8759, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see it focused more on the "face". Like this the eye is captured by the spring detail, loosing the main point of the challenge. Lightning and backgrouns clolour (too noisy)are not great either.</td>', 'I would have liked to see it focused more on the "face". Like this the eye is captured by the spring detail, loosing the main point of the challenge. Lightning and backgrouns clolour (too noisy)are not great either.', '2004-12-29 13:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081598, 130388, 8759, '<td valign="top">You could have gotten rid of the bulbs on top. It would have looked better IMO</td>', 'You could have gotten rid of the bulbs on top. It would have looked better IMO', '2004-12-29 13:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081650, 130810, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice face, but the background is way too confusing and cluttered to show the face to best advanhtage.</td>', 'It''s a nice face, but the background is way too confusing and cluttered to show the face to best advanhtage.', '2004-12-29 13:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081654, 130828, 30861, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see a face here, except maybe a squinting one on the big rock, not really "trhere" for me...</td>', 'I really don''t see a face here, except maybe a squinting one on the big rock, not really "trhere" for me...', '2004-12-29 13:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
