(1081894, 130858, 30508, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat effect you''re going for, but it didn''t quite come together for me.  I think maybe it''s the glasses.  If you could''ve found something better for them, it might have worked better.</td>', 'It''s a neat effect you''re going for, but it didn''t quite come together for me.  I think maybe it''s the glasses.  If you could''ve found something better for them, it might have worked better.', '2004-12-29 15:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
