(1082765, 130855, 23394, '<td valign="top">even though the image quality is poor, this is still one of my favorites in the challenge.  hopefully, you''ll get enough comments to learn from.  the composition is nice, but the colors are a bit dull.  the pixelation can be controlled a bit in the editing process, but it might be that you are asking a bit more from your camera that it is capable.  all the same, nice find, and, if this doesn''t score where you wanted it to, don''t be discouraged.  just keep on shooting!</td>', 'even though the image quality is poor, this is still one of my favorites in the challenge.  hopefully, you''ll get enough comments to learn from.  the composition is nice, but the colors are a bit dull.  the pixelation can be controlled a bit in the editing process, but it might be that you are asking a bit more from your camera that it is capable.  all the same, nice find, and, if this doesn''t score where you wanted it to, don''t be discouraged.  just keep on shooting!', '2004-12-30 07:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
