(1083143, 130323, 30861, '<td valign="top">I take it the face is NOT the man in the moon, but the 3 circles? If so, it''s not really "facing off" for me.  The image usffers from oversharpening on the moon, I think. The haloing is not good here. But it''s an appealing image regardless.</td>', 'I take it the face is NOT the man in the moon, but the 3 circles? If so, it''s not really "facing off" for me.  The image usffers from oversharpening on the moon, I think. The haloing is not good here. But it''s an appealing image regardless.', '2004-12-30 15:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
