(1084238, 130828, 31307, '<td valign="top">Great find!<br/> <br/>I''m curious to know why you didn''t take it from closer up?</td>', 'Great find! I''m curious to know why you didn''t take it from closer up?', '2004-12-31 10:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
