(1084248, 130773, 31307, '<td valign="top">This kind of reminds me of an alien from Star Wars.<br/> <br/>It also reminds me of the Hazardous Radiation symbol.  Without the sharpie-produced features, I don''t think I would have made the face connection were I to see this out of the context of the challenge.</td>', 'This kind of reminds me of an alien from Star Wars. It also reminds me of the Hazardous Radiation symbol.  Without the sharpie-produced features, I don''t think I would have made the face connection were I to see this out of the context of the challenge.', '2004-12-31 10:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
