(1084260, 130767, 31307, '<td valign="top">I assume that the face in this photograph is on the left, but because of its position so far to the left, it''s hard to really distinguish it--part of the face is truncated!</td>', 'I assume that the face in this photograph is on the left, but because of its position so far to the left, it''s hard to really distinguish it--part of the face is truncated!', '2004-12-31 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084263, 130642, 31307, '<td valign="top">Very interesting placement of the subject.  Normally, I would probably have preferred to have a closer, more centered shot, but I actually like it a lot this way.  It sort of implies a subtlety on the part of the viewing stand...thing.<br/> <br/>I get a kick out of it.  Well done!</td>', 'Very interesting placement of the subject.  Normally, I would probably have preferred to have a closer, more centered shot, but I actually like it a lot this way.  It sort of implies a subtlety on the part of the viewing stand...thing. I get a kick out of it.  Well done!', '2004-12-31 11:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084268, 130672, 31307, '<td valign="top">The face in this shot is a little tough to pick out, but I think I see what is being made to look like a face.  This is a difficult medium to show a face in, so I salute you for trying.</td>', 'The face in this shot is a little tough to pick out, but I think I see what is being made to look like a face.  This is a difficult medium to show a face in, so I salute you for trying.', '2004-12-31 11:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084272, 130196, 31307, '<td valign="top">Whoa.  Awesome face.  What''s projecting the silhouette?  The dark background really emphasizes the leaf and its face.  It also adds to the feeling of anger or possibly even evil in the photo.</td>', 'Whoa.  Awesome face.  What''s projecting the silhouette?  The dark background really emphasizes the leaf and its face.  It also adds to the feeling of anger or possibly even evil in the photo.', '2004-12-31 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
