(1084355, 130853, 8637, '<td valign="top">Would have been better with the lid off perhaps...does not allow face to really show off well.  And out of focus object in background distracts from idea.</td>', 'Would have been better with the lid off perhaps...does not allow face to really show off well.  And out of focus object in background distracts from idea.', '2004-12-31 12:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
