(1084465, 130263, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  What a great concept for the challenge...and well done!  I only wish I could get closer to the photo--but then, I suspect, I would wish the rose were real.</td>', 'Sweet!  What a great concept for the challenge...and well done!  I only wish I could get closer to the photo--but then, I suspect, I would wish the rose were real.', '2004-12-31 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084467, 130543, 16488, '<td valign="top">Gritty!  Nicely found!  The texture helps carry this so well.  Wish it were more squred off.</td>', 'Gritty!  Nicely found!  The texture helps carry this so well.  Wish it were more squred off.', '2004-12-31 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084469, 130571, 16488, '<td valign="top">Devilish!  Wonderful portrait with a gothic theme.</td>', 'Devilish!  Wonderful portrait with a gothic theme.', '2004-12-31 14:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084472, 130323, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nicely conceived!  A little soft in the colors and I''m not sure about the fringing on the moon.  But your composition is right on.</td>', 'Nicely conceived!  A little soft in the colors and I''m not sure about the fringing on the moon.  But your composition is right on.', '2004-12-31 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084474, 130317, 16488, '<td valign="top">Ghostly!  A nicely found face!  Just goes to show, I suppose, what one can see when we look around.</td>', 'Ghostly!  A nicely found face!  Just goes to show, I suppose, what one can see when we look around.', '2004-12-31 14:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084476, 130265, 16488, '<td valign="top">Didn''t like this at first because it seemed that the "face" was intended.  But there''s more here than the eyes on the bow.  The weathering which creates the mouth persuaded me to understand that you saw more than there was to see.<br/> <br/>Love the colors, texture, framing.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Didn''t like this at first because it seemed that the "face" was intended.  But there''s more here than the eyes on the bow.  The weathering which creates the mouth persuaded me to understand that you saw more than there was to see. Love the colors, texture, framing.  Nicely done!', '2004-12-31 14:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084485, 130842, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very Halloween-ish!  It seems a bit over-sharped to me.  I like the colors and the face you''ve found.  Perhaps a closer crop left, right and top would focus attention more on the face?</td>', 'Very Halloween-ish!  It seems a bit over-sharped to me.  I like the colors and the face you''ve found.  Perhaps a closer crop left, right and top would focus attention more on the face?', '2004-12-31 14:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084493, 130154, 16488, '<td valign="top">Eerie!  But a bit lacking in contrast and the inclusion of the uninspiring sky doesn''t help.  Amazing find, nonetheless.</td>', 'Eerie!  But a bit lacking in contrast and the inclusion of the uninspiring sky doesn''t help.  Amazing find, nonetheless.', '2004-12-31 14:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084496, 130705, 16488, '<td valign="top">Love the face!  I think you might have done better without the distracting context, though--that lower left corner in shadow adds nothing for me.</td>', 'Love the face!  I think you might have done better without the distracting context, though--that lower left corner in shadow adds nothing for me.', '2004-12-31 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084498, 130616, 16488, '<td valign="top">Cool face--looks like it''s bracing for the next impact.  Interesting frame effect, and am curious how it is achieved....Unfortunately, it detracts interest from the subject.  Yes, it needed a frame to contain it, just not sure this one''s the right one.  I note a second face above--the happy part with red eyes that''s ready to hammer the one below....</td>', 'Cool face--looks like it''s bracing for the next impact.  Interesting frame effect, and am curious how it is achieved....Unfortunately, it detracts interest from the subject.  Yes, it needed a frame to contain it, just not sure this one''s the right one.  I note a second face above--the happy part with red eyes that''s ready to hammer the one below....', '2004-12-31 14:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084500, 130740, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sharp!  There''s just no question why you took this photo. Snapshot-like, sure.  But show it to an uncorrupted grade-schooler and their sure to laugh at what you saw and perfectly conveyed. ( I suppose you could also color correct so that there''s less of a yellow cast to the snow, but I live in a valley where this is the reality.)</td>', 'Sharp!  There''s just no question why you took this photo. Snapshot-like, sure.  But show it to an uncorrupted grade-schooler and their sure to laugh at what you saw and perfectly conveyed. ( I suppose you could also color correct so that there''s less of a yellow cast to the snow, but I live in a valley where this is the reality.)', '2004-12-31 14:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084504, 130478, 16488, '<td valign="top">Complex!  There''s something wonderful about the colors here--just a neat pallet of off-primary.  I would seldom recommend a border, but perhaps a small line, inset, would help the image from spilling out of the frame.</td>', 'Complex!  There''s something wonderful about the colors here--just a neat pallet of off-primary.  I would seldom recommend a border, but perhaps a small line, inset, would help the image from spilling out of the frame.', '2004-12-31 14:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084513, 130706, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting!  I like the way you''ve presented your topic.</td>', 'Lovely lighting!  I like the way you''ve presented your topic.', '2004-12-31 15:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084515, 130747, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nicely found!  I think the frost gives good context to a "seasonal" item gone rotten.  The inclusion of leaves on the right seems so appropriate, but the crop still bothers me--I''m not sure why, maybe it''s just too even top, bottom and left--that''s hardly much to help you, just want more weight below the pumpkin, I guess.</td>', 'Nicely found!  I think the frost gives good context to a "seasonal" item gone rotten.  The inclusion of leaves on the right seems so appropriate, but the crop still bothers me--I''m not sure why, maybe it''s just too even top, bottom and left--that''s hardly much to help you, just want more weight below the pumpkin, I guess.', '2004-12-31 15:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
