(1087294, 129566, 19959, '<td valign="top">Not sure that this quite meets the challenge. Nice sunset and silhouette effect though.</td>', 'Not sure that this quite meets the challenge. Nice sunset and silhouette effect though.', '2005-01-02 17:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087336, 130828, 25742, '<td valign="top">yes it is. so well that I can''t see it. no, sorry, just saw in the L rock. nice flat face.</td>', 'yes it is. so well that I can''t see it. no, sorry, just saw in the L rock. nice flat face.', '2005-01-02 18:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087348, 130543, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast. Simple and effective image. 8</td>', 'Nice contrast. Simple and effective image. 8', '2005-01-02 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087356, 130305, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Nice execution. A tad overexposed in areas but acceptable. 8</td>', 'Great idea. Nice execution. A tad overexposed in areas but acceptable. 8', '2005-01-02 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087358, 130858, 12160, '<td valign="top">I love the color, lighting and the softness of it.... beautiful image. 9</td>', 'I love the color, lighting and the softness of it.... beautiful image. 9', '2005-01-02 18:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087360, 130265, 12160, '<td valign="top">Excellent find for the challenge. One of my top picks. 9</td>', 'Excellent find for the challenge. One of my top picks. 9', '2005-01-02 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087420, 130477, 26151, '<td valign="top">So then they are just eyes? Too bad not a whole face there.</td>', 'So then they are just eyes? Too bad not a whole face there.', '2005-01-02 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087423, 130855, 26151, '<td valign="top">It looks like there is a face on whatever that is, but I''m sure others have told you that the whole picture is quite blurry.</td>', 'It looks like there is a face on whatever that is, but I''m sure others have told you that the whole picture is quite blurry.', '2005-01-02 19:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087426, 130771, 31415, '<td valign="top">Cool Picture!</td>', 'Cool Picture!', '2005-01-02 19:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087428, 130327, 26151, '<td valign="top">That''s cool, but it is intended to be a face. I''m looking for things that are naturally hidden faces in everyday objects. Not created faces.</td>', 'That''s cool, but it is intended to be a face. I''m looking for things that are naturally hidden faces in everyday objects. Not created faces.', '2005-01-02 19:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087429, 130196, 31415, '<td valign="top">Cool Pic</td>', 'Cool Pic', '2005-01-02 19:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087432, 130331, 26151, '<td valign="top">He''s winking at me, I think he likes me. Too bad there is not a nose.</td>', 'He''s winking at me, I think he likes me. Too bad there is not a nose.', '2005-01-02 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087459, 130122, 26151, '<td valign="top">Okay, I see it now. He doesn''t look too angry to me. It also looks a little like Scooby Doo.</td>', 'Okay, I see it now. He doesn''t look too angry to me. It also looks a little like Scooby Doo.', '2005-01-02 20:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087493, 130705, 26151, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, a lot of people probably don''t know who Mr. Bill is. Maybe a little tighter crop or shorter DOF to blur out the buildings in the background.</td>', 'Ha ha, a lot of people probably don''t know who Mr. Bill is. Maybe a little tighter crop or shorter DOF to blur out the buildings in the background.', '2005-01-02 20:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087567, 130642, 17890, '<td valign="top">My favourite - Good Luck (9)</td>', 'My favourite - Good Luck (9)', '2005-01-02 21:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087585, 130747, 5822, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge theme well. I really like the deep rich colors of burnt orange and brown here, as well as, the testure. Imo, the compostiion is lacking and I wish you could have included more brown leaves and green grass to balance things out a bit.  The grain also is film like and very appealing to my eye.</td>', 'Meets the challenge theme well. I really like the deep rich colors of burnt orange and brown here, as well as, the testure. Imo, the compostiion is lacking and I wish you could have included more brown leaves and green grass to balance things out a bit.  The grain also is film like and very appealing to my eye.', '2005-01-02 21:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087587, 130805, 5822, '<td valign="top">Appears overexposed and the format and subject matter seem to clash. With the subject weren''t truncated on bottom.</td>', 'Appears overexposed and the format and subject matter seem to clash. With the subject weren''t truncated on bottom.', '2005-01-02 21:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087598, 129688, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love how this subtly meets the challenge theme with a face on the left side and a face and left shoulder on the right. It appears to be two people in repose maybe lying on a sofa with the man''s arm around the woman in front of a fireplace.  This is exceptionally well done! 10</td>', 'I love how this subtly meets the challenge theme with a face on the left side and a face and left shoulder on the right. It appears to be two people in repose maybe lying on a sofa with the man''s arm around the woman in front of a fireplace.  This is exceptionally well done! 10', '2005-01-02 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087601, 130267, 25468, '<td valign="top">I like the face. I think you would have done just as well without the drape.</td>', 'I like the face. I think you would have done just as well without the drape.', '2005-01-02 21:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087602, 130703, 25468, '<td valign="top">Weird stuff. How on earth did you find this??</td>', 'Weird stuff. How on earth did you find this??', '2005-01-02 21:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087609, 130771, 5822, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit of a stretch for me to see any faces here. What I do see is a bit of posterization or noise.  I don''t find the compostion to be terribly interesting either. Sorry for the blunt comments but hope it was helpful.</td>', 'It''s a bit of a stretch for me to see any faces here. What I do see is a bit of posterization or noise.  I don''t find the compostion to be terribly interesting either. Sorry for the blunt comments but hope it was helpful.', '2005-01-02 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087612, 130853, 25468, '<td valign="top">nice find. It''s strange how you can find faces in the strangest places. Sometimes I see them within the pattern in the carpet.</td>', 'nice find. It''s strange how you can find faces in the strangest places. Sometimes I see them within the pattern in the carpet.', '2005-01-02 21:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087624, 129566, 25468, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this for about ten minutes now. I''ve come to the conclusion that your ''hidden face'' is that of the person in the photo. I don''t necessarily like this idea, nor do I think it represents what they meant by ''hidden faces''. With that said I think the colors alone on this photo are awesome, not to mention the texture of the sky. I really do like the silhouette (spelling?). I think over all it''s an amazing shot, may even go in my favorites. But for the sake of the challenge I didn''t think it was a winner.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this for about ten minutes now. I''ve come to the conclusion that your ''hidden face'' is that of the person in the photo. I don''t necessarily like this idea, nor do I think it represents what they meant by ''hidden faces''. With that said I think the colors alone on this photo are awesome, not to mention the texture of the sky. I really do like the silhouette (spelling?). I think over all it''s an amazing shot, may even go in my favorites. But for the sake of the challenge I didn''t think it was a winner.', '2005-01-02 21:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087625, 129708, 25468, '<td valign="top">Another creepy face hidden through out nature. Good job</td>', 'Another creepy face hidden through out nature. Good job', '2005-01-02 21:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087634, 130828, 25468, '<td valign="top">As I look at this I wonder where the face is. I assume (appologize if I''m wrong) that the rocks are the eyes, and the path is the mouth? If that is the case I was thrown off massively by the tight cropping. I would have liked this alot more without the distracting border.</td>', 'As I look at this I wonder where the face is. I assume (appologize if I''m wrong) that the rocks are the eyes, and the path is the mouth? If that is the case I was thrown off massively by the tight cropping. I would have liked this alot more without the distracting border.', '2005-01-02 21:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087637, 130664, 25468, '<td valign="top">IMHO it''s not really hidden when you set it up. I enjoy your idea, and the B&amp;W looks great but I think you sell yourself short when you set up things like this. Had this been an ad or something I would comment differently.</td>', 'IMHO it''s not really hidden when you set it up. I enjoy your idea, and the B&W looks great but I think you sell yourself short when you set up things like this. Had this been an ad or something I would comment differently.', '2005-01-02 21:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087640, 130122, 25468, '<td valign="top">That''s crazy. So clear and easy to see. Great job.</td>', 'That''s crazy. So clear and easy to see. Great job.', '2005-01-02 21:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087642, 130808, 25468, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I''m not sure which is blue (the light or the jacks) but it''s just way too blue.</td>', 'I like the idea. I''m not sure which is blue (the light or the jacks) but it''s just way too blue.', '2005-01-02 21:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087644, 130265, 25468, '<td valign="top">Mixed feelings about this. I like the mouth, but think the eyes are not that ''hidden''. First time in a while I don''t really know how to vote. 6 for now.</td>', 'Mixed feelings about this. I like the mouth, but think the eyes are not that ''hidden''. First time in a while I don''t really know how to vote. 6 for now.', '2005-01-02 21:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087646, 130388, 25468, '<td valign="top">Like the face in the palette. don''t think you need the lights up top though. Sort of redundant if you ask me (which you didn''t ;) ). 5</td>', 'Like the face in the palette. don''t think you need the lights up top though. Sort of redundant if you ask me (which you didn''t ;) ). 5', '2005-01-02 21:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087649, 129654, 25468, '<td valign="top">That is pretty sweet. ''Nuff said.</td>', 'That is pretty sweet. ''Nuff said.', '2005-01-02 21:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087694, 130807, 5822, '<td valign="top">Focus is really sharp and I really like what you did with the colorful reflections in the chrome. good job.</td>', 'Focus is really sharp and I really like what you did with the colorful reflections in the chrome. good job.', '2005-01-02 22:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087740, 130267, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great idea that could have been carried out a bit better, but I love it anyway!  The composition is terrific and I love the touch of the scarf that gives the back side of the air freshener a human touch.  The blurred and spotted bg along with the overexposed figure gives an outdoor urban appearance.  However, I wish the overexpose wasn''t so extreme and think that focus could be sharper on the subject. Other than that, I think this is brilliant!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-03 00:39:10.</i></td>', 'Great idea that could have been carried out a bit better, but I love it anyway!  The composition is terrific and I love the touch of the scarf that gives the back side of the air freshener a human touch.  The blurred and spotted bg along with the overexposed figure gives an outdoor urban appearance.  However, I wish the overexpose wasn''t so extreme and think that focus could be sharper on the subject. Other than that, I think this is brilliant!', '2005-01-02 22:38:33.000000', '2005-01-03 00:39:10.000000', 1),
(1087781, 130263, 25468, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see the face. Maybe I''m missing something.</td>', 'I really don''t see the face. Maybe I''m missing something.', '2005-01-02 22:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087783, 130839, 25468, '<td valign="top">subtle, but I like it. Good find.</td>', 'subtle, but I like it. Good find.', '2005-01-02 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087786, 130769, 25468, '<td valign="top">Not too hidden when you draw it with your finger. At least to me that''s what it looks like. Thanks for entering.</td>', 'Not too hidden when you draw it with your finger. At least to me that''s what it looks like. Thanks for entering.', '2005-01-02 22:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087788, 130718, 25468, '<td valign="top">IMHO this looks set up. I am not a fan of it personally. thanks for entering.</td>', 'IMHO this looks set up. I am not a fan of it personally. thanks for entering.', '2005-01-02 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087790, 130568, 25468, '<td valign="top">I don''t think IMHO that a snow man constitutes a ''hidden face''. I like the composition of the photo just think you fell short on the challenge. thanks for entering.</td>', 'I don''t think IMHO that a snow man constitutes a ''hidden face''. I like the composition of the photo just think you fell short on the challenge. thanks for entering.', '2005-01-02 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087791, 130319, 25468, '<td valign="top">I think this fell short on the challenge simply because it''s set up. thanks for entering.</td>', 'I think this fell short on the challenge simply because it''s set up. thanks for entering.', '2005-01-02 23:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087794, 130745, 25468, '<td valign="top">Ooh a skull, excellent entry. I would have enjoyed it more had the ''skull'' been more centered but hey, I''m just the peanut gallery.</td>', 'Ooh a skull, excellent entry. I would have enjoyed it more had the ''skull'' been more centered but hey, I''m just the peanut gallery.', '2005-01-02 23:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087798, 130836, 25468, '<td valign="top">The set of faces I believe you are showing should be more of the shot. I think there is too much distraction in all the ''open'' space. I wouldn''t have cropped in so tight that I killed the shot, I just think you left too much of the other rocks in the photo</td>', 'The set of faces I believe you are showing should be more of the shot. I think there is too much distraction in all the ''open'' space. I wouldn''t have cropped in so tight that I killed the shot, I just think you left too much of the other rocks in the photo', '2005-01-02 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087800, 130317, 25468, '<td valign="top">Pretty freaky, but not that uncommon. Thanks for not setting it up :)</td>', 'Pretty freaky, but not that uncommon. Thanks for not setting it up :)', '2005-01-02 23:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087803, 130762, 25468, '<td valign="top">Maybe I misread the challenge description, but I don''t think this is a hidden face within nature that wasn''t intended to be a face. Great shot those, I like the catch in the eyes.</td>', 'Maybe I misread the challenge description, but I don''t think this is a hidden face within nature that wasn''t intended to be a face. Great shot those, I like the catch in the eyes.', '2005-01-02 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087807, 130851, 25468, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. While I don''t think you set up the eye on the cane, I do feel it was meant to be there. That said I like the shot, great composition and nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot. While I don''t think you set up the eye on the cane, I do feel it was meant to be there. That said I like the shot, great composition and nice lighting.', '2005-01-02 23:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087824, 130658, 9906, '<td valign="top">It sure is a face, but not too attractive of an image...<br/>TC</td>', 'It sure is a face, but not too attractive of an image...TC', '2005-01-02 23:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087830, 130855, 9906, '<td valign="top">INteresting composition!  Much potential here.  Things to improve:  Focus is soft.  Colors are very dull (levels adjustments needed in photoshop or whatever program you use...) Light colored plant parts (stem or piece of straw) that runs from middle left to upper right if removed simplifies the composition.<br/>TC</td>', 'INteresting composition!  Much potential here.  Things to improve:  Focus is soft.  Colors are very dull (levels adjustments needed in photoshop or whatever program you use...) Light colored plant parts (stem or piece of straw) that runs from middle left to upper right if removed simplifies the composition.TC', '2005-01-02 23:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087832, 130773, 9906, '<td valign="top">Don''t usually go for the more abstract shots, but this one is kinda neat...<br/>TC</td>', 'Don''t usually go for the more abstract shots, but this one is kinda neat...TC', '2005-01-02 23:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087840, 130744, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great composition, but to me it looks flat both color wise and in depth.  Moving your lighting more to one side or the other (I would say to photographers right) would help with the depth issue.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great idea, great composition, but to me it looks flat both color wise and in depth.  Moving your lighting more to one side or the other (I would say to photographers right) would help with the depth issue.TC', '2005-01-02 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087841, 130566, 9906, '<td valign="top">Cute!  How long was your exposure?  How many times did you have to atempt this to get it right?  Bic lighter?<br/>TC</td>', 'Cute!  How long was your exposure?  How many times did you have to atempt this to get it right?  Bic lighter?TC', '2005-01-02 23:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087842, 130733, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very small, very dull, not very interesting...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very small, very dull, not very interesting...TC', '2005-01-02 23:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087845, 130340, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I''m still deciding if I like the grain or not.  Seems to work well here.  Should have cleaned the bottle or cloned out the specks in the glass for a cleaner shot.<br/>TC<br/>PS:  The Wife says it looks more like a horse than a gas mask...</td>', 'Very cool.  I''m still deciding if I like the grain or not.  Seems to work well here.  Should have cleaned the bottle or cloned out the specks in the glass for a cleaner shot.TCPS:  The Wife says it looks more like a horse than a gas mask...', '2005-01-02 23:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087846, 130767, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t see it...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t see it...TC', '2005-01-02 23:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087848, 130762, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot!  Love the simple elegance of the composition!  Great catchlight in the eyes.  Just a hint of detail through the veil.  Unfortunately it doesn''t fit the challenge details...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a stunning shot!  Love the simple elegance of the composition!  Great catchlight in the eyes.  Just a hint of detail through the veil.  Unfortunately it doesn''t fit the challenge details...TC', '2005-01-02 23:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
