(1087937, 130807, 13749, '<td valign="top">congrats on your ribbon, shannon! now you''re never gonna let us forget how great that little 28-75 you''ve been praising is.. maybe you can sell me yours when you get tired of it ;)</td>', 'congrats on your ribbon, shannon! now you''re never gonna let us forget how great that little 28-75 you''ve been praising is.. maybe you can sell me yours when you get tired of it ;)', '2005-01-03 00:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
