(1088366, 130263, 25347, '<td valign="top">Woohoo, another top 20.  I''m moving on up, eh?<br/> <br/>For those of you who begged and inquired and are curious about how this was done, see the orginal and its comments:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=131165" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25347/thumb/131165.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25347/thumb/131165.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25347/thumb/131165.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Cheers<br/> <br/>I wonder if they''ll let me write a "How''d They Do That?" about this one... that''d be fun.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-03 06:44:16.</i></td>', 'Woohoo, another top 20.  I''m moving on up, eh? For those of you who begged and inquired and are curious about how this was done, see the orginal and its comments:  Cheers I wonder if they''ll let me write a "How''d They Do That?" about this one... that''d be fun.', '2005-01-03 06:43:31.000000', '2005-01-03 06:44:16.000000', 0),
