(1088476, 130736, 25024, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. This was done by taking lots of shots of the rippled reflections of a modern brick bridge next to my boat. the ''eyes'' are the sky, the dominant colour (red/brown) is the brickwork, the grey/black is the roof of the bridge and the white is the concrete lintels. The ripples were totally unpredictable so I needed a card full of shots to find a ''face''</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. This was done by taking lots of shots of the rippled reflections of a modern brick bridge next to my boat. the ''eyes'' are the sky, the dominant colour (red/brown) is the brickwork, the grey/black is the roof of the bridge and the white is the concrete lintels. The ripples were totally unpredictable so I needed a card full of shots to find a ''face''', '2005-01-03 09:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
